# Slash workflow

Context: **`AGENTS.md`**, **`core/project-conventions.mdc`** (immutable graph, user-goals, data-model).

**Invoke:** `/` in chat → pick command or skill. **Canonical prose** lives in **`.cursor/commands/*.md`**; repeatable runners in **`.cursor/skills/*/SKILL.md`**. Shared task-file rules: **`workpkg-hygiene.mdc`**.

| Intent | Slash / skill |
| --- | --- |
| New multi-step initiative, fuzzy goals | `/define-project` |
| Goals clear → task files | `/define-tasks` |
| Execute one tracked task | `/implement-task` (attach `_OVERVIEW` + task markdown) |
| Post-project QA pass | `/review-project` |
| ShaderToy gap analysis | `/analyze-shadertoy` |
| CI / Pages green | `/prepare-commit` (`npm run verify:pages`; skill **`prepare-commit`**) |
| Architecture findings → maybe WPs | `/review-architecture` (skill **`review-architecture`**) |
| Performance findings → maybe WPs | `/review-performance` (skill **`review-performance`**; deep dive **`runtime-performance-scan`**) |
| Structured pass on one shader node | `/review-node` |
| Capture investigated bug | `/write-bug` (skill **`document-bug`**) |
| Close loop on `docs/bug/` report | `/review-bug` (skill **`investigate-and-fix-bug`**) |
| Prune / relocate stale `docs/`; refresh architecture vs code | `/cleanup-docs` |
| Clean up shipped `docs/implementation/` packages | See `docs-implementation-done-cleanup.mdc` |
| Audit Cursor agent config itself | `/review-agent-tooling` |
| Audit `$effect` usage vs Svelte 5 guidance | `/audit-svelte-effects` |
| Accessibility baseline check | skill **`a11y-check`** |
| Safe serialization / migration change | skill **`data-model-migration`** |
| Safe graph shape refactor | skill **`graph-safe-refactor`** |
| Export pipeline vs user-goals | skill **`export-pipeline-check`** |
| Preset JSON maintenance | skill **`preset-maintenance`** |
| Add / change shader node | skill **`add-shader-node`** |
| Add / change audio graph pieces | skill **`add-audio-node`** |
| New Svelte component | skill **`add-svelte-component`** |
| Refactor existing Svelte UI | skill **`refactor-svelte`** |
| Run checks and summarize | skill **`run-tests-and-summarize`** |
| Orient a new contributor / agent session | skill **`onboard-contributor`** |
| Coach modes (sanitized handoffs) | `/coaching-internal`, `/coaching-external`, `/coaching-sub` |

After big structural changes: consider new/updated **`docs/`** or **`.cursor/rules/`** entries — propose separately, don’t fold into unrelated implementation PRs unless required.
